flowchart TD
 T[Trigger: user/API/scheduler/webhook] --> C[Establish context]
 C --> A[Authenticate and authorize]
 A --> V[Validate input, state, ACL, record rules]
 V -->|valid| S[Execute domain service]
 V -->|invalid/denied| E[Explicit error response]
 S --> P[Persist transaction and side effects]
 P --> R[Commit and render/return]
 P -->|failure| X[Rollback or compensating action]
